Subject: 020-add-v2-merklix-overlay-arenas: add persistent Merklix overlay
 arenas and O(1) commitment helpers

Rolls in unified SmtNode::script_pubkey preservation and frozen-epoch
re-anchoring so UtxoOverlayArena and lock-free RCU gettxout share a single
SmtNode representation.
